e7mek i\u00e7in bir a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r men\u00fc g\u00f6recek. Uygun koltuklar tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131ya g\u00f6re s\u0131ralanm\u0131\u015f bir listede g\u00f6sterilir. Bu, k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck mekanlar veya g\u00f6rsel koltuk se\u00e7imi gerekmedi\u011finde idealdir."],"Visual Layout (Seat Map)":["G\u00f6rsel D\u00fczen (Koltuk Haritas\u0131)"],"Customers will see an interactive seat map where they can click on available seats. Occupied seats are shown in a different color. This provides a visual overview of the venue. (Premium feature)":["M\u00fc\u015fteriler, uygun koltuklara t\u0131klayabilecekleri etkile\u015fimli bir koltuk haritas\u0131 g\u00f6recek. Dolu koltuklar farkl\u0131 bir renkte g\u00f6sterilir. Bu, mekan\u0131n g\u00f6rsel bir genel g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc sa\u011flar. (Premium \u00f6zellik)"],"Seat":["Koltuk"],"Seating Plan":["Oturma Plan\u0131"],"Description":["Aciklama"],"Active":["Etkin"],"Inactive":["Devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131"],"Activate":["Etkinle\u015ftir"],"Status":["Durum"],"Export CSV":["CSV D\u0131\u015fa Aktar"],"Edit":["Duzenle"],"Delete":["Sil"],"Cancel":["Iptal"],"Drag to reorder":["Yeniden s\u0131ralamak i\u00e7in s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin"],"Remove":["Kald\u0131r"],"Label":["Etiket"],"Name":["Ad"],"Show Layout":["D\u00fczeni G\u00f6ster"],"Hide Layout":["Yerle\u015fimi Gizle"],"Delete %d seats?":["%d koltuk silinsin mi?"],"%d seats updated":["%d koltuk g\u00fcncellendi"],"%d seats deleted":["%d koltuk silindi"],"%d seats processed, %d errors":["%d koltuk i\u015flendi, %d hata"],"selected":["se\u00e7ildi"],"-- Action --":["-- \u0130\u015flem --"],"Deactivate":["Devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak"],"Layout":["D\u00fczen"],"Seats":["Koltuklar"],"Actions":["\u0130\u015flemler"],"Visual (Seat Map)":["G\u00f6rsel (Koltuk Haritas\u0131)"],"Simple (Dropdown)":["Basit (A\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r Men\u00fc)"],"View Venue Photo":["Mekan Foto\u011fraf\u0131n\u0131 G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle"],"Open Designer":["Tasar\u0131mc\u0131y\u013